# Everything here is excluded from the build context.
#
# It is not only about size. The context is uploaded to the Docker daemon and
# anything copied in ends up in the image — `.git` alone can carry your whole
# history, and a stray `.env` bakes a live secret into a layer that anyone who
# pulls the image can read back out.

.git
.github
.gitignore
.venv
venv
__pycache__
*.pyc
*.pyo
.pytest_cache
.ruff_cache
.coverage
htmlcov
coverage.xml
k8s
tests
docs
*.md
.env
.env.*
